    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "We have developed a new Poly3D_Pro graphical user interface for Poly3D, that allows geologic scientists, educators and students to quickly and easily visualize and analyze data on many of the computer platforms in use today. Poly3D_Pro is written in Java and able to read files from local disks. We describe the design and evolution of Poly3D_Pro, including its current display and analysis capabilities, and planned future development. The present version has been tested under Windows operating system (95/98/NT) and Linux RedHat 6.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
